    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1115">

                <pb facs="0806" n="690" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg690"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.48/1865.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Consul Garrett.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-09-29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 29, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>On September 25, Consul General Hanna was instructed to notify all Consuls in
                    Northern Mexico to discontinue furnishing assistance to refugees from Mexico.
                    Similar instructions sent to Veracruz and Tampico.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
